\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
This is -1 before \fBsc_init\fP has been called and a proper package identifier (>= 0) afterwards\&. After \fBsc_finalize\fP the identifier resets to -1\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
This routine is not thread-safe\&. 
.RE
.PP

