.SS "void sc_init (\fBsc_MPI_Comm\fP mpicomm, int catch_signals, int print_backtrace, sc_log_handler_t log_handler, int log_threshold)"

.PP
Sets the global program identifier (e\&.g\&. the MPI rank) and some flags\&. This function is optional\&. This function must only be called before additional threads are created\&. If this function is not called or called with log_handler == NULL, the default SC log handler will be used\&. If this function is not called or called with log_threshold == SC_LP_DEFAULT, the default SC log threshold will be used\&. The default SC log settings can be changed with sc_set_log_defaults ()\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fImpicomm\fP MPI communicator, can be sc_MPI_COMM_NULL\&. If sc_MPI_COMM_NULL, the identifier is set to -1\&. Otherwise, sc_MPI_Init must have been called\&. Effectively, we just query size and rank\&. 
.br
\fIcatch_signals\fP If true, signals INT and SEGV are caught\&. 
.br
\fIprint_backtrace\fP If true, sc_abort prints a backtrace\&. 
.RE
.PP

