.PP

.SS "void sc_package_lock (int package_id)"

.PP
Acquire a pthread mutex lock\&. If configured without --enable-pthread, this function does nothing\&. This function must be followed with a matching \fBsc_package_unlock\fP\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIpackage_id\fP Either -1 for an undefined package or an id returned from \fBsc_package_register\fP\&. Depending on the value, the appropriate mutex is chosen\&. Thus, we may overlap locking calls with distinct package_id\&. 
.RE
.PP

